    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106487" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρο-χόος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>water-pourer,</i> name of the constellation <i>Aquarius,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eudox.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hipparch.
				1.2.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				1.6.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euc.
				<u>Phaen.</u>
				p.12
			</span></i> M., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.199
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>); 
				contr.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρο-χοῦς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				7.363.5
			</span></i>, al. (Dura-Europus, <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>):—dat.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδροχοῆϊ</span> (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδροχοεύς</span>), 
				Ep.
			 for the common <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδροχόῳ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				389
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				23.315
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> name of an
			Egyptian month, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φαρμοῦθι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				465.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
